I have fully implemented the `clam_pearl_guard` game according to the blueprint, section 15 architecture, and section 16 acceptance criteria. 

### What was created:
1. **`Scripts/ClamPearlGuardConfig.cs`**: Single static configuration class containing all physical constants and thresholds.
2. **Core Pure C# Classes**: `PalmFrame`, `PearlRegistration`, `CurlEstimator`, `CageClassifier`, `SunCharger`, `BarracudaDirector`, `PearlState`, `ClamRenderer`, `TideDirector`, `FeedbackDirector`, and `SessionFSM`.
3. **`Scripts/clam_pearl_guardRig.cs`**: Thin MonoBehaviour wiring the core logic to transforms and runtime systems.
4. **`Scripts/Editor/AcceptanceTests.cs`**: Complete NUnit test suite covering all section 16 requirements (`Test01` through `Test14`).
5. **`BUILD_LOG.md`**: Full build summary detailing status, class list, constant sources, and automated tests.
